rule section121_two_persons_gain_cap with provenance "(1) In general; (A) $500,000 Limitation for certain joint returns":
the section121 two persons gain cap is an amount N if
    the rule section121 two persons section 121 b 2 A condition holds
    and N = 500000
    otherwise the section121 two persons section121Person1 gain cap is N.

